 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** The SDF evaluation is the most expensive step, scaling with the number of candidate points [S1, unofficial]. Exact asymptotic bounds are Not given in the sources.
-- **Memory Complexity:** Proportional to the number of candidate points generated before filtering [S1, unofficial]. Exact asymptotic bounds are Not given in the sources.
